            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi avayo, arahunga, aja mw isenga ry’i Adulamu. Bukeye bakuru be na bene wabo bose bavyumvise, baramanuka bamusangayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umuntu wese yari mu magorwa, n’ūrin’umwenda, n’ūgendana imyidogo bakoranira kuri we, aba umukuru wabo; nukw abo bantu bāri kumwe na we bāri nk’amajana ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
