        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami avyumvise, atuma guhamagaza Ahimeleki umuherezi, mwene Ahitubu, n’ab’ inzu ya se bose, ari bo baherezi b’i Nobu; bose bītaba umwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitse, Sauli aravuga, ati Wewe mwana wa Ahitubu! Na we ati Sabge mugenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli aramubaza, ati N’iki catumye mungīra inama, mwe na mwene Isayi, ukamuha ivyo kurya n’inkota, ukamusiguriza Imana, ngw ankūrire hasi, abe umwansi wanje, nk’uko bimeze ubu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimeleki yishura umwami, ati Mbega none mu basavyi bawe bose har’ uwoba umwizigirwa nka Dawidi umukwe w’ umwami, ari we aganza abagushibamira, akaba umunyacubahiro mu rugo rwawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ugira ngo ni bgo bga mbere kumusiguriza Imana? Ntibikabeho ko nokora nk’ivyo! Mugenzi, ntunshirekw ikintu nk’ico, jewe umusavyi wawe, canke ku b’inzu ya data iyo bava bakagera; kukw ata kintu na kimwe nari nzi mur’ ivyo vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami aramwishura, ati Nta kabuza, ntugenda udapfuye, mwe n’ab’ inzu ya so bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.10.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 10:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami araheza abarira abashibamyi bamukikije, ati Ni mukūre hasi, mwice abo baherezi b’Uhoraho, kuko bāfatanye agatoke na Dawidi, kandi bāri bazi ko yahunze, ntibabimbarire. Arikw abo bantu b’umwami ntibemera gukoza amaboko kur’ abo baherezi b’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 2:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.2.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami abarira Dowegi, ati Kūra hasi weho, wice abo baherezi. Nuko Dowegi Umunyedomu akūra hasi, arabica; uwo musi yica abantu mirongumunani na batanu bambara efodi yera derere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 15:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ i Nobu, igisagara c’abaherezi, akigeseza n’ inkota, abagabo n’abagore, abana n’abonka, bo n’inka n’indogoba n’intama, vyose abimarira ku nkota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ umwe mu bahungu ba Ahimeleki mwene Ahitubu, yitwa Abiyatari, aracīka, ahungira iyo Dawidi ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abikira Dawidi ko Sauli yagesheje abaherezi b’ Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 21:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dawidi abarira Abiyatari, ati Wa musi, aho nabona Dowegi Umunyedomu, namenye kw atazobura kubibarira Sauli: abo mu nzu ya so bose ni jewe bazize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 20:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 2:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N’ugume aho ndi, ntutinye; kuk’ ūmpīga ari we aguhīga: ariko ni wagumana nanje nta co uzoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
